From 05b7336f354e52aedfe91da5df98511fca5a7580 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 12:55:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] fs: r9fs: add read-only Rust 9P2000.L file system over
 virtio

r9fs is a new, separate file system (not a replacement for fs/9p) that
speaks 9P2000.L over a virtio-9p channel. The module registers both a
virtio driver (r9fs_virtio) and the r9fs file system type.

Supported: mount by virtio tag, version/attach, walk, getattr, lopen,
read, readdir, readlink, statfs and clunk. The mount is read-only, has
no page cache (cache=none semantics) and serializes one outstanding
request per channel.

Mount options: trans=virtio, version=9p2000.L, msize, uname, aname, uid.
